Package: michka-hub
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Michka <michka@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, adduser
Recommends: libssl3 | libssl3t64, ca-certificates
Description: Michka hardware monitor hub (self-contained web dashboard)
 Michka is a cross-platform hardware dashboard. This package installs the hub: one
 self-contained .NET binary that hosts a web server and serves a touch-friendly dark
 dashboard (CPU / memory / network / disk / temperatures / services), collects local
 metrics, accepts pushes from Michka agents, stores history in SQLite, and streams live
 updates to browsers over SSE.
 .
 The hub runs headless as an unprivileged system user and is reached from any browser on
 the network. Install the michka-kiosk package as well to turn the machine into a
 self-contained touchscreen appliance (cage + Chromium on tty1).
